#: scenario8:scenario8_B77B9324_C68A_4471_972E_2BC1BEA37683
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1962f6382083ebc25d99b765deb1177e0a5b1d95a945540db5397a8ae05aba2
