#: scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34b4a1c61b09cf3859d7d5e52244a735275c770b4e5666f9b096ef74a675186e
