msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Welcome home, dearest Mell! What did you buy today?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Bem-vindo ao lar, querido Mell! O que você comprou hoje?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37d911f1e9ce2421cca2b0543de78e25ad3dcc1c155769aabe504e62abbe562d
