"supposed to cook it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas está toda...⟪k:2⟫coberta de penas e batendo as asas...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Como deveríamos "
"cozinhá-la?"

