#: scenario8:scenario8_8679902E_3CEE_4D0F_88B8_EFC38308A715
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61a3422d92727fbe76f6e7ccfea0eeccac8d790afc7e3c0b5c89f0167bcfcb1e
