msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8679902E_3CEE_4D0F_88B8_EFC38308A715"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Back home, Nellie had tended to be, ⟪k:1⟫well, ⟪k:2⟫a bit of a princess.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was "
"frequently harsh with the abigails, scolding them for the smallest of things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lá em casa, Nellie tendia a ser, ⟪k:1⟫bem, ⟪k:2⟫um pouco como uma princesa.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ela era "
"frequentemente dura com as abigails, repreendendo-as pelo menor das coisas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4DA95E7E_E2AA_4ABF_B734_EE7BF10DA8B0
